  "description": "Each YITAMOTOR tonneau cover is custom-built to fit your truck perfectly, ensuring an exact and secure fit. Crafted from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl, these covers are engineered to withstand the elements, providing durability and long-lasting performance. Unlike other covers, YITAMOTOR tonneau covers will not stretch, fade, or crack, keeping your truck bed protected and looking sharp for years to come.\nFitment\n2007-2026 Chevy Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500 new body style\n2007-2019 Silverado/Sierra 2500 3500 HD (DO NOT FIT Multi-flex tailgate and Carbonpro Bed)\nFeatures\nCompatibility: Fit for 6.6’bed of 2007-2026 Chevy Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500 new body style and 2007-2019 Silverado/Sierra 2500 3500 HD (DO NOT FIT Multi-flex tailgate and Carbonpro Bed); Custom-fit solution to increase truck bed utility\nElement-Proof Cargo Cover: Crafted with high-quality Fiberglass Reinforced Polymer (FRP) sheet, our truck bed tonneau cover offers reliable scratch resistance and protection against different weather elements including rain, snow, dirt, and UV rays. Enjoy reliable durability without fading, cracking, or flaking\nNo-drill Installation: Install the hard tri-fold tonneau cover in no time without any drilling or modifications needed; Comes with detailed instructions for added convenience; Note that if your truck has cargo racks, remove them before installing this cover\nAll-around Strength: Non-slip FRP sheet works with PP honeycomb structure to achieve bearing capacity up to 450 pounds; Embedded clamps and reinforced latches prevent accidental opening during driving for increased safety; Includes LED light to facilitate item retrieval in dim or dark conditions\nEasy Folding and Warning: Gain flexible bed access by single, dual, or tri-folding the cover and securing with nylon straps; Please be sure to install the tonneau cover as specified by the instructions, and tighten all the bolts before driving; Never drive with the cover partially open",
